1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,820
AI is used to help solve problems in many fields now.
如今，人工智能被用来帮助解决许多领域的问题。

2
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:09,750
Here’s how it helps save energy, protect animals, and reduce pollution.
下面就来看看它是如何帮助节约能源、保护动物和减少污染的。

3
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:16,220
In many office buildings, people sometimes forget to turn off the lights or the air conditioners.
在许多办公楼里，人们有时会忘记关灯或关空调。

4
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:20,290
As a result, a lot of electricity is wasted.
结果，大量的电被浪费掉了。

5
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:24,020
Thanks to AI, the problem can be solved.
多亏了人工智能，这个问题能够得到解决。

6
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:29,110
It learns what the temperature is and how many people are inside the buildings.
它会了解温度是多少，以及楼里有多少人。

7
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:34,060
Then it makes thousands of small changes to save electricity every day.
然后，它每天会做出数以千计的小调整来节约用电。

8
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:39,460
No single change is big, but all of them together can make a big difference.
单看每一项调整都不大，但所有调整合在一起，就能起到很大的作用。

9
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,100
Another problem is about hunting wild animals.
另一个问题与猎杀野生动物有关。

10
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:48,670
You can’t imagine how many kinds of wild animals around the world are in danger now.
你无法想象，如今世界各地有多少种野生动物正面临危险。

11
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:53,870
Luckily, AI can collect all the data to learn from the past hunting events.
幸运的是，人工智能可以收集所有数据，以便从过去的猎杀事件中学习。

12
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:57,190
Then it can guess where the hunters will go next.
然后，它就能推测出猎人下一步会去哪里。

13
00:00:57,990 --> 00:01:03,820
It was once used in a certain area, and the number of hunting events dropped from 19 a month to zero.
它曾在某个地区投入使用，当地的猎杀事件数量从每月19起降到了零。

14
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:06,710
How can AI help reduce pollution?
人工智能怎样帮助减少污染呢？

15
00:01:07,510 --> 00:01:11,850
To clean up plastic waste from the ocean, you first need to know where it is.
要清理海洋中的塑料垃圾，首先需要知道垃圾在哪里。

16
00:01:12,650 --> 00:01:15,640
However, it’s difficult because the ocean is too wide.
然而，这很困难，因为海洋太辽阔了。

17
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:20,980
But with satellites, AI can quickly make a map to show where the plastic is.
但借助人造卫星，人工智能可以迅速绘制出一张地图，显示塑料在什么地方。

18
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:29,390
This helps clean up the ocean much more efficiently, because the ships can be sent to the right places to collect the plastic waste quickly.
这有助于让清理海洋的工作高效得多，因为可以把船只派到合适的地点，迅速收集塑料垃圾。

19
00:01:30,190 --> 00:01:32,650
However, none of these benefits come for free.
不过，这些好处没有一样是白白得来的。

20
00:01:33,450 --> 00:01:36,090
Training AI also uses a lot of energy.
训练人工智能也要消耗大量能源。

21
00:01:36,890 --> 00:01:38,600
So we should make wise choices.
所以，我们应该做出明智的选择。
